1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
Care for local wildlife

2
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:31.746
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Care for local wildlife. Animals ko space, clean water aur respectful distance chahiye hoti hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:31.746 --> 00:01:04.127
Park ke birds ko door se observe karna unhe disturb karne se behtar hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:04.127 --> 00:01:40.317
Ek safe wildlife rule likho aur batao ki usse animal ko kaise help milti hai. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
