Ab practice karo: Wild animal ko dekhte waqt kya karna chahiye? Thoda rukkar socho. Sahi jawab hai Safe distance rakho. Baaki options kyun fit nahi hote, yeh bhi apne shabdon mein batao. Animals ko space, clean water aur respectful distance chahiye hoti hai. Park ke birds ko door se observe karna unhe disturb karne se behtar hai. Is idea ko yaad rakhne ke liye apni notebook mein ek chhota labelled drawing banao. Jab tum apne shabdon mein samjha paate ho, tab tumne sirf answer nahi yaad kiya, balki uska reason bhi samjha. Aaj ka chhota recap: Animals ko space, clean water aur respectful distance chahiye hoti hai. Agli baar aas-paas ki duniya mein isi idea ka ek aur example dhoondhna.

